  m_Name: Unauthorized intervention with an electrical panel
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  hazardName: Unauthorized intervention with an electrical panel
  description: Do not perform tasks that are outside your job description or for
    which you are not authorized. Never intervene in an electrical panel without
    obtaining the required work permit from the Sustainability Department and without
    the presence of authorized personnel. In all areas where electrical panels are
    located, dielectric insulating mats of appropriate thickness according to the
    electrical potential difference must be provided.
